{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_25","type":"agent_message","text":"The first browser run loaded the game on WebGPU, but the software GPU lost its device before drawing the scene. I’m checking recovery to Three.js’s compatibility renderer and using that path for visual inspection. I’m also adding a single-command test suite for campaign completion, rescues, resupply, failure and restart, co-op, input, and Hub conformance.\n"}}
